  "title": "武英殿本梁書卷二十一王瞻傳",
  "catalog_revision": 902340163,
  "catalog_permalink": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=902340163",
  "pdf_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/NLC892-411999017142-12657_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC166%E5%86%8A.pdf",
  "pdf_sha1": "b11514da8e27fc149ba1ddc8e42a71bd01cd4e25",
  "holding": "中國國家圖書館，NLC892-411999017142-12657，二十四史第166冊。卷首刻乾隆四年校刊。",
  "column_file": "source-evidence/liang021-wangzhan/wyd-columns.txt",
  "column_file_sha256": "590434796825e6c8212ce54153d2f891874b28625aadf377aa69ef53f6734473",
  "columns": [
    {
      "pdf_page": 2,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "一上",
      "column_from_right": 7,
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "reading": "王瞻字思範琅邪臨沂人宋太保弘從孫也祖柳光祿"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 2,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "一上",
      "column_from_right": 8,
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 42,
      "reading": "大夫東亭侯父猷廷尉卿瞻年數歲嘗從師受業時有"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 2,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "一上",
      "column_from_right": 9,
      "start_codepoint": 42,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "reading": "伎經其門同學皆出觀瞻獨不視習誦如初從父尚書"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 2,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "一上",
      "column_from_right": 10,
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 84,
      "reading": "僕射僧達聞而異之謂瞻父曰吾宗不衰寄之此子年"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "一下",
      "column_from_right": 1,
      "start_codepoint": 84,
      "end_codepoint": 105,
      "reading": "十二居父憂以孝聞服闋襲封東亭侯瞻幼時輕薄好"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "一下",
      "column_from_right": 2,
      "start_codepoint": 105,
      "end_codepoint": 126,
      "reading": "逸遊為閭里所患及長頗折節有士操涉獵書記於棊"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "一下",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "start_codepoint": 126,
      "end_codepoint": 147,
      "reading": "射尤善起家著作佐郎累遷太子舍人太尉主簿太子"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "一下",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "start_codepoint": 147,
      "end_codepoint": 168,
      "reading": "洗馬頃之出為鄱陽內史秩滿授太子中舍人又為齊"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "一下",
      "column_from_right": 5,
      "start_codepoint": 168,
      "end_codepoint": 189,
      "reading": "南海王友尋轉司徒竟陵王從事中郎王甚相賓禮南"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "一下",
      "column_from_right": 6,
      "start_codepoint": 189,
      "end_codepoint": 210,
      "reading": "海王為護軍將軍瞻為長史又出補徐州別駕從事史"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "一下",
      "column_from_right": 7,
      "start_codepoint": 210,
      "end_codepoint": 231,
      "reading": "遷驃騎將軍王晏長史晏誅出為晉陵太守瞻潔己為"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "一下",
      "column_from_right": 8,
      "start_codepoint": 231,
      "end_codepoint": 252,
      "reading": "政妻子不免飢寒時大司馬王敬則舉兵作亂路經晉"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "一下",
      "column_from_right": 9,
      "start_codepoint": 252,
      "end_codepoint": 273,
      "reading": "陵郡民多附敬則軍敗臺軍討賊黨瞻言於朝曰愚人"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "右",
      "leaf": "一下",
      "column_from_right": 10,
      "start_codepoint": 273,
      "end_codepoint": 294,
      "reading": "易動不足窮法明帝許之所全活者萬數徵拜給事黃"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "二上",
      "column_from_right": 1,
      "start_codepoint": 294,
      "end_codepoint": 315,
      "reading": "門侍郎撫軍建安王長史御史中丞高祖霸府開以瞻"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "二上",
      "column_from_right": 2,
      "start_codepoint": 315,
      "end_codepoint": 336,
      "reading": "為大司馬相國諮議參軍領錄事梁臺建為侍中遷左"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "二上",
      "column_from_right": 3,
      "start_codepoint": 336,
      "end_codepoint": 357,
      "reading": "民尚書俄轉吏部尚書瞻性率亮居選部所舉多行其"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "二上",
      "column_from_right": 4,
      "start_codepoint": 357,
      "end_codepoint": 378,
      "reading": "意頗嗜酒每飲或竟日而精神益朗贍不廢簿領高祖"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "二上",
      "column_from_right": 5,
      "start_codepoint": 378,
      "end_codepoint": 399,
      "reading": "每稱瞻有三術射棊酒也尋加左軍將軍以疾不拜仍"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "二上",
      "column_from_right": 6,
      "start_codepoint": 399,
      "end_codepoint": 420,
      "reading": "為侍中領驍騎將軍未拜卒時年四十九諡康侯子長"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 3,
      "half": "左",
      "leaf": "二上",
      "column_from_right": 7,
      "start_codepoint": 420,
      "end_codepoint": 427,
      "reading": "玄著作佐郎早卒"
    }
  ],
